<title>USA: Loewen says to review Service Corp bid.</title>
<headline>Loewen says to review Service Corp bid.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Loewen Group Inc said it will review a takeover offer launched earlier by rival Service Corp International.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that its board of directors will respond to the offer in due course.</p>
<p>Loewen also said it has asked its legal and financial advisors to review the bid in light of regulatory, industry and financial issues raised by the offer.</p>
<p>Earlier Wednesday, Service Corp launched a hostile takeover valued at $45 per share, or about $2.9 billion.</p>
</text>
